    <span style="display:none;visibility:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;height:0;width:0;font-size:0;">4 rides, 213.7 km this week on Tarmoto.</span>
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#0f172a;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding:32px 16px;">
          <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:560px;background:#1e293b;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;">
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:24px 32px;border-bottom:1px solid #334155;">
                <span style="color:#06b6d4;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:0.02em;">Tarmoto</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:32px;color:#f8fafc;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">
                
      <p>Hi Riku,</p>
      <p>Here's your week on the road.</p>
      <table role="presentation" width="100%" style="margin:20px 0;border-collapse:collapse;">
        
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:6px 0;color:#94a3b8;font-size:14px;">Rides</td>
        <td style="padding:6px 0;color:#f8fafc;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;text-align:right;">4</td>
      </tr>
        
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:6px 0;color:#94a3b8;font-size:14px;">Distance</td>
        <td style="padding:6px 0;color:#f8fafc;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;text-align:right;">213.7 km</td>
      </tr>
        
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:6px 0;color:#94a3b8;font-size:14px;">Time in the saddle</td>
        <td style="padding:6px 0;color:#f8fafc;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;text-align:right;">6h 12m</td>
      </tr>
        
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:6px 0;color:#94a3b8;font-size:14px;">Best road quality</td>
        <td style="padding:6px 0;color:#f8fafc;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;text-align:right;">4.2 / 5</td>
      </tr>
      </table>
      <p style="color:#cbd5e1;">You've now ridden <strong style="color:#f8fafc;">512</strong> road sections — <strong style="color:#f8fafc;">38%</strong> of your area explored.</p>
      <p style="margin:32px 0;">
        <a href="https://app.tarmoto.example/explore" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background:#06b6d4;color:#0f172a;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;border-radius:8px;">Find your next road</a>
      </p>
    
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:24px 32px;border-top:1px solid #334155;color:#94a3b8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;">
                You're receiving this digest as part of your Tarmoto subscription. <a href="https://app.tarmoto.example/settings/notifications" style="color:#06b6d4;">Unsubscribe from marketing emails</a>.
              </td>
            </tr>
